    "text": "If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mn>14</mn></math> and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></msup></math> are the first three terms of an A.P. for some&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math> , then the sixth term of this A.P. is",
